{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/Bingeljell/status/2105364806379151765","id":"2105364806379151765","text":"Free image-to-3D models don't preserve your source image - text, logos and fine detail come back garbled. \nI got that working with my latest 'Pixel Match' feature in my image-to-3dlab: it copies the actual pixels from your source onto the model, even after retopo down to ~5k faces. High quality, low poly 3D models that are riggable and can be animated. \nOne step closer to Tripo / Meshy level of output, but free and on your own machine. Mac + NVIDIA. \nTry it out here: https://github.com/Bingeljell/image-to-3dlab\n\nThere's lots more to do, so please test, raise issues & PRs, etc.","raw_text":{"text":"Free image-to-3D models don't preserve your source image - text, logos and fine detail come back garbled. \nI got that working with my latest 'Pixel Match' feature in my image-to-3dlab: it copies the actual pixels from your source onto the model, even after retopo down to ~5k faces. High quality, low poly 3D models that are riggable and can be animated. \nOne step closer to Tripo / Meshy level of output, but free and on your own machine. Mac + NVIDIA. \nTry it out here: https://t.co/fCh7Ft9x9m\n\nThere's lots more to do, so please test, raise issues & PRs, etc.","display_text_range":[0,562],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[276,299],"id":"2105354132051947520","display":"pic.x.com/40n1Qg4IZZ","original":"https://t.co/40n1Qg4IZZ","replacement":"https://x.com/Bingeljell/status/2105364806379151765/video/1"},{"type":"url","indices":[472,495],"original":"https://t.co/fCh7Ft9x9m","replacement":"https://github.com/Bingeljell/image-to-3dlab","display":"github.com/Bingeljell/ima…"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Bingeljell","url":"https://x.com/Bingeljell","id":"17698904","followers":868,"following":624,"likes":9195,"media_count":860,"name":"Nikhil Shahane","description":"Building with AI. Worklings (desktop pet × dungeon crawler). Current rabbit hole: image→3D, in-browser + agentic 3D. ✝︎ b'tzelem Elohim\nhttp://nikhilshahane.com","raw_description":{"text":"Building with AI. Worklings (desktop pet × dungeon crawler). Current rabbit hole: image→3D, in-browser + agentic 3D. ✝︎ b'tzelem Elohim\nhttps://t.co/oazj1P2FAT","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[136,159],"original":"https://t.co/oazj1P2FAT","replacement":"http://nikhilshahane.com","display":"nikhilshahane.com"}]},"location":"Mumbai, India","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/17698904/1424083529","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1864285290351013888/4cQu6UVk_200x200.jpg","joined":"Fri Nov 28 04:27:09 +0000 2008","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":17,"retweets":47,"likes":471,"bookmarks":678,"quotes":2,"created_at":"Wed Sep 30 18:31:00 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790793060,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":22502,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"media":{"all":[{"id":"2105354132051947520","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2105354132051947520/vid/avc1/1080x1350/SALVDbSroWh83hsF.mp4?tag=29","thumbnail_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2105354132051947520/img/alVE6PC19SzTEwrJ.jpg","duration":38.5,"width":1080,"height":1350,"format":"video/mp4","type":"video","formats":[{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2105354132051947520/pl/5Ycq8pXAGmxH9Mwi.m3u8?tag=29","container":"m3u8"},{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2105354132051947520/vid/avc1/320x400/W83NqlHoLOPDStl2.mp4?tag=29","bitrate":632000,"container":"mp4","codec":"h264"},{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2105354132051947520/vid/avc1/480x600/Y6CybGAZlJZJG8xY.mp4?tag=29","bitrate":950000,"container":"mp4","codec":"h264"},{"url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2105354132051947520/vid/avc1/720x900/-DE8vXMCDwTBi17E.mp4?tag=29","bitrate":2176000,